Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Stage=20706=20=E2=80=94=20the=20city=20tells=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?each=20client=20what=20is=20near=20it?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Interest management for city rooms only (shared/net/interest.ts): other
files within 72 m (kept to 82 m), at most 8 of them nearest first; machines,
charges and smoke on the same radius; anything hunting, hurting or hit by
the client from anywhere (3 s hold); a public event's machines from 120 m,
and from anywhere to its participants; gunfire from files in view and
machines within hearing; the feed always. The city sends its roster
(Msg.CityRoster, JSON) so the file count still knows the whole room, and a
file that walks in without a gate arrives at the spawn nearest somebody.

Match, run and every non-city room are byte-identical on the wire
(tests/interest.test.ts holds hashes taken before the change). 24 files
spread over LEASE ROW: 17.9 -> 7.1 KB/s per client; crowded and firing:
20.9 -> 9.6.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
